        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>The cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift version 1.15 or later supports the <code>AllNamespaces</code>, <code>SingleNamespace</code>, and <code>OwnNamespace</code> installation modes. Earlier versions, such as 1.14, support only the <code>SingleNamespace</code> and <code>OwnNamespace</code> installation modes.</p>
